<Base
  title="Foldable Breakfast Table — Sebastián Ortiz de Zevallos"
  description="Furniture for a 25 m² Airbnb apartment."
  currentPage="projects"
>
  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__year">2021 · Design</div>
    <h1 class="project__title">Foldable Breakfast Table</h1>
    <p class="project__subtitle">Personal work · with Carolina Rivera</p>

    <div class="project__body">
      <p>
        This set of one table and two chairs was part of a bigger project that
        included the whole interior design of a 25-square-meter apartment that
        would be mainly rented for Airbnb. The place would only consist of a bed
        that merged into a closet with cabinets for basic storage and a desk; the
        terrace only had a small bar and a bench, and there was a preexisting
        kitchenette and bathroom design.
      </p>

      <p>
        Therefore, we wanted to create a piece of furniture that could turn this
        minimal and ultra-efficient design into something cozier and more
        homelike.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project__gallery">
      <figure class="project__gallery-item">
        <img
          src="/images/foldable-breakfast-table/01.jpg"
          alt="Foldable breakfast table — plans and details"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><a href="/projects">← All projects</a></div>
      <div>2021</div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
